{"id":"de-l11","type":"lesson","lang":"de","level":"Starter","day":11,"title":"Health & pharmacy","phrases":[{"ar":"Wo ist die nächste Apotheke?","roman":"voh ist dee NEKH-steh ah-poh-TAY-keh","en":"Where is the nearest pharmacy?","ur":"قریب ترین فارمیسی کہاں ہے؟","note":"Look for the red 'A' sign."},{"ar":"Ich brauche einen Arzt.","roman":"ikh BROW-kheh Y-nen ahrtst","en":"I need a doctor.","ur":"مجھے ڈاکٹر چاہیے۔"},{"ar":"Ich habe Kopfschmerzen.","roman":"ikh HAH-beh KOPF-shmer-tsen","en":"I have a headache.","ur":"میرے سر میں درد ہے۔"},{"ar":"Ich habe Fieber.","roman":"ikh HAH-beh FEE-ber","en":"I have a fever.","ur":"مجھے بخار ہے۔"},{"ar":"Ich habe Husten.","roman":"ikh HAH-beh HOO-sten","en":"I have a cough.","ur":"مجھے کھانسی ہے۔"},{"ar":"Mir ist schlecht.","roman":"meer ist shlekht","en":"I feel sick.","ur":"میری طبیعت خراب ہے۔"},{"ar":"Ich habe einen Termin um zehn Uhr.","roman":"ikh HAH-beh Y-nen ter-MEEN oom tsayn oor","en":"I have an appointment at ten.","ur":"دس بجے میری اپوائنٹمنٹ ہے۔"},{"ar":"Wie oft am Tag?","roman":"vee oft ahm tahk","en":"How often a day?","ur":"دن میں کتنی بار؟"},{"ar":"Vor oder nach dem Essen?","roman":"for OH-der nahkh daym ES-sen","en":"Before or after meals?","ur":"کھانے سے پہلے یا بعد میں؟"},{"ar":"Rufen Sie einen Krankenwagen!","roman":"ROO-fen zee Y-nen KRAHN-ken-vah-gen","en":"Call an ambulance!","ur":"ایمبولینس بلائیں!","note":"Emergency number in Germany: 112."},{"ar":"Gute Besserung!","roman":"GOO-teh BES-seh-roong","en":"Get well soon!","ur":"اللہ صحت دے!"}]},
{"id":"de-l12","type":"lesson","lang":"de","level":"Starter","day":12,"title":"Phone & appointments","phrases":[{"ar":"Hallo, hier ist Shakeel.","roman":"HAH-loh, heer ist Shakeel","en":"Hello, this is Shakeel.","ur":"ہیلو، میں شکیل بول رہا ہوں۔","note":"Germans often answer the phone with their surname."},{"ar":"Wer spricht da?","roman":"vair shprikht dah","en":"Who is speaking?","ur":"کون بات کر رہا ہے؟"},{"ar":"Einen Moment, bitte.","roman":"Y-nen mo-MENT, BIT-teh","en":"One moment, please.","ur":"ایک لمحہ، براہ مہربانی۔"},{"ar":"Ich verstehe Sie schlecht.","roman":"ikh fer-SHTAY-eh zee shlekht","en":"I can't hear you well.","ur":"آپ کی آواز ٹھیک سے نہیں آ رہی۔"},{"ar":"Ich rufe später zurück.","roman":"ikh ROO-feh SHPAY-ter tsoo-RÜK","en":"I'll call back later.","ur":"میں بعد میں فون کروں گا۔"},{"ar":"Ich schicke Ihnen eine Nachricht.","roman":"ikh SHIK-keh EE-nen Y-neh NAHKH-rikht","en":"I'll send you a message.","ur":"میں آپ کو میسج بھیجتا ہوں۔"},{"ar":"Wie ist Ihre Nummer?","roman":"vee ist EE-reh NOO-mer","en":"What is your number?","ur":"آپ کا نمبر کیا ہے؟"},{"ar":"Ich möchte einen Termin machen.","roman":"ikh MÖKH-teh Y-nen ter-MEEN MAH-khen","en":"I'd like to make an appointment.","ur":"میں اپوائنٹمنٹ لینا چاہتا ہوں۔"},{"ar":"Passt Ihnen Dienstag?","roman":"pahst EE-nen DEENS-tahk","en":"Does Tuesday suit you?","ur":"کیا منگل آپ کے لیے ٹھیک ہے؟"},{"ar":"Ich bin gerade in einer Besprechung.","roman":"ikh bin geh-RAH-deh in Y-ner beh-SHPREKH-oong","en":"I'm in a meeting right now.","ur":"میں ابھی میٹنگ میں ہوں۔"},{"ar":"Auf Wiederhören!","roman":"owf VEE-der-hö-ren","en":"Goodbye! (on the phone)","ur":"خدا حافظ! (فون پر)","note":"On the phone say 'Wiederhören' (hear again), not 'Wiedersehen' (see again)."}]}
]
